:CoMACRu co_n, CoPtrM^", rnd" is ExtCountDec & co_op=0x83 & co_ext=0x31 & co_n & CoPtrM { local b:2 = CoPtrM; MAC_ACC = mac_CoMACRu(MAC_ACC, co_n, b); }
:CoMAX co_n, CoPtrM is ExtCountDec & co_op=0x83 & co_ext=0x3A & co_n & CoPtrM { local b:2 = CoPtrM; MAC_ACC = mac_CoMAX(MAC_ACC, co_n, b); }
